      <p><code>UtilityClass.deprecated</code> <span class="schema-list__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="visually-hidden">uses</span> <a href="#definition-NativeDeprecation"><code>NativeDeprecation</code></a></p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p class="schema-list__title"><a href="/docs/schemas/v0.4/icons/">Icons</a></p>
